    // it destroys each kind of target, 0 (cannot) .. 8: shelter, runway, aircraft (parked),
    // building, bridge, bunker (hardened headquarters), depot, launcher, radar, rig (offshore),
    // industry, pen (submarine pens), small_ship, large_ship, armour. The mission generator
    // reads the aircraft and these too.
